{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c579bb9-e0bd-8062-a1b6-c2e4f9f86df7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-08T13:54:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:52:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:52:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm trying this line. Is this the right one for plowing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:52:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, this is the one on weekends. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My mother's car is plowed in. City plow came down her street and left a wall of snow behind it. Her car's not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:52:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:52:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "168 Carroll Avenue. Fifth Ward. I'm her son, Joel, I'm calling for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 168 Carroll. So the plow banked it in at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And honestly it's a dusting. It barely snowed. It's just freezing out, a real cold snap, so what the plow pushed is packed like concrete. How's that even happen with a dusting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the plow scrapes up whatever's on the road plus what was already frozen. It piles up heavier than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So will somebody come back and clear it? Or is she supposed to dig it out herself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the residents clear the end of their own spot. I'll put in a note for the crew, though. No promise on when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Then can I get sand? The sidewalk and the driveway are glazed over, and she's not going out there on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'm writing sand request, 168 Carroll Avenue. Is there a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven two. Good. And do you know how I'd know it's done? Is that what you're asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, how do I know it's actually on the list? I'm not driving over there to find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair. It's logged now, and the crew sees it Monday morning at the latest, or sooner if they're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Monday latest. Got it. Sorry, I'm just in her garage hunting for a shovel and all I'm finding is paper towels. She buys in bulk, I swear, way too much paper towel. Tons of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that won't dig her out. Hang in there, Joel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks. Monday, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T13:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday at the latest. Take care."
    }
  ],
